@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……案外、<br>ここで暮らす方が<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_15_03\">楽</link>かもしれない。|#0205Trial15_AnAn004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"だからわがはいは<br>べつにここから出ることを<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_15_04\">望んではいない</link>。|#0205Trial15_AnAn005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

